<h2>What is Microsoft Azure?</h2>
<p>
    Microsoft Azure is a cloud computing platform and service offered by Microsoft, providing a wide range of cloud services including computing, analytics, storage, and networking.
</p>

<h3>Key Features of Azure</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Scalability:</strong> Easily scale applications up or down based on demand.</li>
    <li><strong>Global Reach:</strong> Data centers across the world ensure high availability and reliability.</li>
    <li><strong>Security & Compliance:</strong> Built-in security features and compliance certifications.</li>
    <li><strong>Hybrid Cloud:</strong> Supports hybrid deployments for on-premises and cloud integration.</li>
    <li><strong>AI & Machine Learning:</strong> Offers AI services, cognitive APIs, and machine learning models.</li>
    <li><strong>Containerization:</strong> Supports Docker, Kubernetes, and serverless computing.</li>
    <li><strong>Integration with Microsoft Tools:</strong> Seamless integration with Office 365, Power BI, and Dynamics 365.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Azure Services Categories</h3>
<p>
    Azure provides various services categorized into the following domains:
</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Compute:</strong> Virtual Machines, Azure Functions, App Services</li>
    <li><strong>Storage:</strong> Blob Storage, SQL Database, Cosmos DB</li>
    <li><strong>Networking:</strong> Virtual Network, Load Balancer, CDN</li>
    <li><strong>Security:</strong> Azure Active Directory, Key Vault</li>
    <li><strong>AI & Analytics:</strong> Azure Machine Learning, Cognitive Services</li>
</ul>

<h3>Common Use Cases</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Hosting Websites and Web Applications</li>
    <li>Cloud-based Data Storage and Backup</li>
    <li>Building AI-powered Applications</li>
    <li>Internet of Things (IoT) Solutions</li>
    <li>Hybrid Cloud Deployments</li>
</ul>

<h3>Conclusion</h3>
<p>
    Microsoft Azure is a powerful cloud computing platform that offers a comprehensive suite of tools and services to meet the needs of businesses, developers, and enterprises worldwide.
</p>
